# Healthcare Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview

This project is a healthcare analytics solution built in Power BI.

The dashboard helps hospital management monitor:

- Patient Admissions
- Department Performance
- Doctor Performance
- Readmission Rates
- Patient Satisfaction
- Financial Performance

---

## Data Model

### Fact Table

FactVisits

### Dimension Tables

- DimPatient
- DimDoctor
- DimDepartment
- DimDisease
- DimDate

---

## KPIs

- Total Patients
- Total Visits
- Total Revenue
- Average Length of Stay
- Readmission Rate
- Average Satisfaction Score

---

## Dashboard Pages

### Executive Overview

Provides hospital-wide KPIs and trends.

### Department Performance

Analyzes departmental workload and revenue.

### Doctor Performance

Measures doctor efficiency and patient outcomes.

### Financial Dashboard

Tracks revenue and cost metrics.

---

## Tools Used

- Power BI
- DAX
- Power Query
- GitHub

